# An alternative cost changes what is paid, never the spell's mana value (CR 118.9c, 202.3). Mine Collapse cast by
# sacrificing a Mountain rather than paying its mana cost spends no mana at all (CR 118.9), so Ashling, Rimebound's
# {B}{B} stays in the pool. Baleful Mastery cast for its alternative {1}{B} is still a spell of mana value 4, so that
# {B}{B} - "only to cast spells with mana value 4 or greater" (CR 106.6) - pays all of it, and an opponent draws a card.
# Each exiles or kills one of Bot2's Ornithopters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Ashling, Rekindled
Mine Collapse
Baleful Mastery
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x20

